id=star2lte_audit
name=star2lte Overlay Auditor
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=mehran
description=READ-ONLY. Maps every file in the /vendor overlayfs upper to the module that owns it, and flags orphans, stale copies, driver shadows and boot-critical whiteouts. Its ACTION button only prints a report - it never moves or deletes anything.
